Subject: SUMMARY: adding disks to sw230 raid array
X-MARC-Message: https://marc.info/?l=tru64-unix-managers&m=96076337821677

Reply To: b.oconnor@bendigo.latrobe.edu.au
X-Mailer: ELM [version 2.4 PL25]
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=US-ASCII
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 7bit
