To: tru64-unix-managers
Subject: DECTHREADS Bug with Digital Unix 4.0
X-MARC-Message: https://marc.info/?l=tru64-unix-managers&m=96076337821674

Hi,

This message is to call everyones attention to a serious DECTHREADS bug in 
Digital Unix 4.0.

The bug manifests itself with a "segmentation violation" (SEGV) in the
fork() system call.

DEC has a patch available which fixes this OSF400-0037. It looks like
this patch fixes a bunch of other issues as well.

Anyone running DU 4.0 should strongly consider installing this patch <IMHO>.

Anyone considering an upgrade should look into this patch <IMHO>.

