   (see Q2 below)
 - configure them with the same kind of NFS mounts of the previous DECs
   (at this stage or later)
 - migrate and customize any local shell script from the DECs to the Alphas
 - reinstall all necessary software on the Alphas
 - test it
   (up to here the DECs remain on, at least 2 of them)
 - move the nameserver either to an Alpha or elsewhere to a Sun
 - switch the DECs off
 - attach the disks and tapes formerly on the DECs to the Alphas (again
   see Q2)
   (at this point we should have attained the final configuration)

