     (we know how to this for Suns, we have "re-christened" upgraded Suns
     quite often, and once also we did this for the DECs when we moved from
     1 machine to 3 machines)   

Q2:  Concerning addition of peripherals, is it true that, contrary to the 
     DECs, one has to reconfigure the kernel each time a new SCSI device is
