To: tru64-unix-managers
Subject: SUMM: Dec polycenter & Exceed 5.0
X-MARC-Message: https://marc.info/?l=tru64-unix-managers&m=96076337821679

The original problem:

DEC polycenter scheduler crashes when I use Exceed 5.0 for Windows. It works
great on a workstation.

Again, the list comes to the rescue !

Thanks to Brian James O'Connor <boc@ironbark.bendigo.latrobe.edu.au> who
responded quickly and gave me the solution.

Dec Polycenter scheduler NEEDS at least a screen reolution of 1024x768
pixels. If it doesn't have that, it crashes as soon as you open a jobset.
Never saw such a stupid behavior from a program ! My workstation was using
1024x768 and my PC was set at 800x600. I would have NEVER tought of it !

Again THANKS !

